at something in the U.S.

00:10:03.335 --> 00:10:08.073
As a Canadian,
I'm "sorry," but, no, you can't.

00:10:08.073 --> 00:10:11.610
I know we're friendly, but
Canada's not your safe house.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.213
I mean, we barely let Canadians
into Canada anymore.

00:10:14.213 --> 00:10:16.982
So please...pick somewhere else.

00:10:16.982 --> 00:10:20.352
I hear -- I hear Finland is
really lovely this time of year.

00:10:20.352 --> 00:10:22.187
You have to stop.

00:10:22.187 --> 00:10:24.090
-This has been
"You Have To Stop."

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.424
My thanks to Ryan Reynolds.

